# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in real values. `.env` is git-ignored.

# NOTE: this file is read by the app's configuration loader, which arrives in
# Phase 4 (see PRPs/prds/sniffdash.prd.md). Until then, set these as real
# environment variables instead.

# --- Parsing (Phase 1) ---
